nesium ordered:** No explicit orders for BMP/BNP/magnesium were found in the chart.\n*   A referral for home health nursing was declined on 2026-09-04 due to cost [SQL:referral], [SYN-Y-NOTE-0012#chunk-0].\n*   A referral for transport assistance was requested on 2026-09-15 after the patient inquired about transport [SQL:referral], [SYN-Y-NOTE-0013#chunk-0].\n\n**Symptoms, Adherence, Cost/Transport/Home-Health Barriers from Notes:**\n*   **Symptoms:** Patient was admitted with dyspnoea and leg oedema on 2026-06-03 [SYN-Y-NOTE-0008#chunk-0]. Readmitted with orthopnoea on 2026-07-19 [SYN-Y-NOTE-0009#chunk-0]. On 2026-09-15, patient reported new ankle swelling and needing two pillows to sleep, with a weight of 73.9 kg (3.1 kg above discharge weight) [SYN-Y-NOTE-0013#chunk-0].\n*   **Adherence:** Patient admitted to stopping afternoon furosemide doses to avoid frequent urination [SYN-Y-NOTE-0009#chunk-0]. Furosemide refill was picked up 9 days late [SYN-Y-NOTE-0010#chunk-0]. On 2026-09-15, patient reported taking all medicines, including the potassium tablet [SYN-Y-NOTE-0013#chunk-0].\n*   **Barriers:** Patient declined home health nursing due to cost [SYN-Y-NOTE-0012#chunk-0]. Patient expressed difficulty with medication copays on a fixed income [SYN-Y-NOTE-0010#chunk-0]. Patient inquired about transport assistance [SYN-Y-NOTE-0013#chunk-0].\n\n**Citable Source IDs and Titles/Table Descriptions:**\n*   [SQL:patient]: Patient demographics and visit reason.\n*   [SQL:condition]: Patient's medical conditions.\n*   [SQL:encounter]: Patient's hospital admissions and readmissions.\n*   [SQL:lab_result]: Patient's lab results (Potassium, Sodium, Creatinine, eGFR, BNP).\n*   [SQL:medication]: Patient's active medications.\n*   [SQL:appointment]: Patient's scheduled and requested appointments.\n*   [SQL:referral]: Patient's referrals.\n*   [SQL:cohort_benchmark]: Cohort comparison data for eGFR change.\n*   [SYN-Y-NOTE-0008#chunk-0]: Patient Y - Hospital admission (2026-06-03) 