139:{"type": "delegate", "t": 1791233033.124, "agent": "lead", "subagent": "medication-safety", "request": "Please provide the missing details for your formal resolution of medication-safety escalation #18 for Patient Y. Your prior response only said 'Care Action ID: 139; Status: needs_physician.' For the final brief I need the exact medication_change proposed or declined, the resolved escalation id, rationale, and the doctor-decides statement under CP-02. Context: escalation #18 was hold lisinopril due to hyperkalemia; Patient Y has K 5.6, eGFR 42, BNP 1410, active lisinopril 10 mg daily and spironolactone 25 mg daily; potassium chloride hold already executed and should not be repeated; prior spironolactone hold was proposed but no decision documented. Use citations limited to [SQL:lab_result], [SQL:medication], [MEDQUAD-01695], [PMID-31809752], [PMID-30481200]. Return concise structured fields: escalation_id, disposition, medication_change_action_id, exact_change, rationale, cp02_status."}
